-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §34: from תשס"ט, a teaching employee under the
-- reform who studies for certification or a degree no longer chooses fewer
-- hours, and gets tuition refunds only; an exceptions committee, with the
-- union, may approve fewer hours instead.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT conventions

§ `34 עובדי הוראה הלומדים לימודי הסמכה או לימודים אקדמאיים`

DECLARE `study benefit` IS ONE OF `fewer hours`, `tuition refunds`

-- (א): from 1.9.2008 (the school year תשס"ט) the choice of fewer hours is
-- gone; tuition refunds by the rules as they are from time to time.
-- (ב): fewer hours instead of refunds only by the exceptions committee's
-- approval, on the rules for teachers off the reform (and after the whole
-- system has moved, those in force on the eve of the move).
@ref akn:art_34__para_a akn:art_34__para_b
GIVEN `year starts` IS A DATE, `approved by the exceptions committee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `study benefit`
DECIDE `the study benefits open to a reform teacher` `year starts` `approved by the exceptions committee` IS
    IF NOT `year starts` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008)
    THEN LIST `fewer hours`, `tuition refunds`
    ELSE IF `approved by the exceptions committee` THEN LIST `fewer hours` ELSE LIST `tuition refunds`

DECLARE `section 34 action` IS ONE OF `set up the exceptions committee`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 34 action`
DECIDE `the exceptions committee` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `set up the exceptions committee`
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 34(ב): an exceptions committee, with the teachers' union, is set up in the Ministry"

#ASSERT `the study benefits open to a reform teacher` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009) FALSE EQUALS LIST `tuition refunds`
#ASSERT `the study benefits open to a reform teacher` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2009) TRUE EQUALS LIST `fewer hours`
